  {
   "type": "card",
   "headline": "What the [NTSB] found.",
   "hsize": 74,
   "p": {
    "items": [
     "Risks of handling an empty ship in high water not properly assessed",
     "Strong current behind her, turning into the wind",
     "Bridge team lost track of the ship's position",
     "2nd hit: master distracted by a phone call"
    ],
    "hl": 3,
    "y": 520,
    "step": 2.6,
    "max": 34
   },
   "narration": "The NTSB found that the pilot and the master did not properly assess the risks of handling an empty ship in high water, with a strong current behind her, turning into the wind. The bridge team lost track of the ship's position. And for the second hit, the master was distracted by a phone call.",
   "_dur": 23.069
  },
  {
   "type": "card",
   "headline": "[Lessons] for every bridge.",
   "p": {
    "items": [
     "A pilot on board never removes the master's duty",
     "After an accident, no call matters more than a ship still moving",
     "Talk through wind, current and ballast condition before the bend"
