    "numbered": true,
    "y": 560,
    "step": 3.2,
    "max": 30
   },
   "narration": "The lessons. A pilot on board never removes the master's duty to navigate safely. After an accident, no phone call is more important than a ship that is still moving. And talk through the wind, the current and the ship's condition before the bend, not in it.",
